<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major></Major>
    <Description>Quick Switch to AR For Fortnite 

Pickaxe Is Scroll Wheel Down

AR Slot Keybind is 1
Or you can use it for Pump or Shotgun or what ever gun you use in slot one 
can be used for most games but created for fortnite Quick Switch Guns
</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>WheelDown 1
Delay 15 ms
KeyDown 30 1
Delay 15 ms
KeyUp 30 1
Delay 15 ms</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Fortnite</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>